/T (Ni#y Snippet: 2008 was a pivotal moment for JavaScript when Google created the Chrome V8 Engine. The V8 engine is an open source high- performance JavaScript engine, wriBen in C++ and used in the Chrome browser and powers Node JS. The performance outmatched any engine that came before it mainly because it combines 2 parts of the engine, the interpreter and the compiler. Today, all major engines use this same technique. )
/E (Ni#y Snippet: 2008 was a pivotal moment for JavaScript when Google created the Chrome V8 Engine. The V8 engine is an open source high- performance JavaScript engine, wriBen in C++ and used in the Chrome browser and powers Node JS. The performance outmatched any engine that came before it mainly because it combines 2 parts of the engine, the interpreter and the compiler. Today, all major engines use this same technique. )
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [4]
